</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Kushta shud barozay ashura hussain(a.s)</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>dar zameene karmay karbala hussain(a.s)</p>
<p>teshna lab futa adab has jafa hussain(a.s)</p>
<p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x3</p>
<ol><li>(Dasht may tukray hwa) x2 hay shahadeen ka badan</li><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Baal khulay huway zehra(s.a) yeh buka karnay lagi</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Meray bachay ka koi mohniso ghamkhwar nahi</p><p>(Ek musafir ko milay) x2</p><p>Kitnay yahan ranjho mahan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Jis ka moo chumkay kehtay they rasol-e-(s.a.w) dosara </li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>May hoon shabir(a.s) say or mujh say hai shabir(a.s) mera</p><p>(Woh muhammad(s.a.w) ka pisar) x2</p><p>Qatl hwa teshnadahan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Koi mehman pay kya karta hai is tarhan jafa</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Tera zarbo say kiya shimr nay sar tan say juda</p><p>(Teen din tak woh raha) x2</p><p>Dasht may bay goro kafan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Khaak aloda badan dekh ke kehtay hai nabi(s.a.w)</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Ay musalman bata ajr-e-risalat hai yahi</p><p>(Kaisay paamal kiya) x2</p><p>Tu nay yeh nazuk sa badan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Qatl ke baad bhi kartay hai sitam ahl-e-jafa</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Teray lashay ko sitamgaro nayu pamaal kya</p><p>(Bain karti hi rahi) x2</p><p>Dasht may mazloom behan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Aik behan rait ke telay pay buka karnay lagi</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Phair di shimr-e-sitamgaar nay gardan per chori</p><p>(Karbala kaanp uthi) x2</p><p>Roti rahi shah ki behan</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Baday pamaal laino nay sitam yeh bhi kye</li><p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p><p>Kati angosht sitamgar nay anghoti k lye</p><p>(Yeh sitam kaisa huwa) x2</p><p>Ronay lagay dasht-o-daman</p><p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p><li>Tum bhi ""farhan"" saray farshe aza karna dua</li></ol>

<p>Ya hussain(a.s) ya hussain(a.s)</p>
<p>Bazme matam may jo allah(j.j) say ""mazhar"" nay kaha</p>
<p>(Mawt jab aye mujhay) x2</p>
<p>Ho meray hoton pay sukhan</p>
<p>(parah parah mashud parah parah mashud, jisme shahenshahe zaman) x2</p></font></p>
               
